  "responsibility": "The query options and freshness of the listing, a board's document, a picture and a board's locality",
  "description": "No timer: a picture and a document stay fresh until their board announces a new version, and are read again on a reconnect. The last picture of the same board stays as the placeholder while another reading of it is drawn. A board's locality is asked once for each pick of a part, and never on a timer, a return to the tab or a reconnect. Every key names a vault, because two repositories can each have a board of the same name. A listing it reads is handed to the refresh module, which reads again what moved since.",
